                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "Atmospheric trace gas measurements from a Lightweight Stratospheric Air Sampler (LISA). These contain several profiles of measured CO<sub>2</sub>, CO, CH<sub>4</sub>, and N<sub>2</sub>O mole fractions and relative isotope ratio measurements of carbon-13 and oxygen-18 in CO. The measurements are taken between 12 and 26 km altitude."
